	(text "POWER – one protected 18650 → 5 V for the Pi 3 A+ (Pololu U3V70F5) and 3.3 V for the radio (AP2112K)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "21148ef6-3736-520f-b51d-a0e383ec5c01")
	)
	(text "1  BATTERY, FUSE & REVERSE PROTECTION"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ee65e8bc-bb64-5717-ba8b-4c0082f55110")
	)
	(text "Protected 18650 (PCM inside, trip >= 3 A) in a holder on the box floor, JST-VH lead to J20.\nQ1: body diode conducts for a correct cell, then VGS = -VBAT turns it on; a reversed cell is blocked.\nDMP2035U <= 45 mΩ at -2.5 V (AO3401A ~85 mΩ: ~0.25 V at 3 A). C5: bulk at the boost input (Pololu asks\nfor >= 33 uF when the cell is on a lead). Charger (J23) on VBAT: Q1 conducts both ways once on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aef1e3ba-5628-566d-b419-ab1c973ae911")
	)
	(text "2  CHARGER LEAD (TP4056 USB-C module at the box wall)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.16 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "82d9d7dd-1461-5f98-9258-d348c1089659")
	)
	(text "TP4056 USB-C module with protection (HW-373), off-board where the USB-C is reachable:\nits B+/B- to this lead (1 A charge; XH is rated 3 A). OUT+/OUT- unused.\nNo power path: charge with the box switched OFF. Check its CC resistors with a C-to-C cable."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.16 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d38366bc-2a48-5f9e-a5c9-c5b5f0fe88c3")
	)
	(text "3  POWER TOGGLE → BOOST EN (closed = ON)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 256.54 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "09eb512e-3986-5ad8-a405-b303e744de2c")
	)
	(text "Toggle closed: PWR_G = 0 → Q2 off → the module's own 100 k pull-up holds EN high → boost ON.\nToggle open (or a broken lead): R8 → Q2 on → EN low → boost OFF (true shutdown, output disconnected).\n~40 µA either way. R9/C18: filter + ESD for the panel lead."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 256.54 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "491cda6e-beaa-519e-85da-78eef7b36bc1")
	)
	(text "4  5 V BOOST MODULE (Pololu U3V70F5)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1b716f14-57e5-5c40-8144-65d569ca1a11")
	)
	(text "~2.9 A out at 3.0 V in (Pololu graph), 5.0 V ±4 %, reverse-voltage protected, UVLO 2.4/2.8 V, Iq < 1 mA.\nENABLE: 100 k pull-up to VIN on the module, < 0.4 V = true shutdown (load disconnected).\nHigh-current loop: J20 → F1 → Q1 → U2 VIN, U2 GND → J20 GND: short and wide (1.5 mm), star point at J20.\nKeep U2 at the opposite end of the board from J30 (radio)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7a6b8ac6-6fc8-5ec2-94a0-fdf483c89f39")
	)
	(text "5  BACK-POWER IDEAL DIODE (Pololu #5388) & 5V_PI AT THE IDC HEADER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.16 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "92a3b46f-1ab8-52ad-a331-e7829a97831a")
	)
	(text "< 3 mΩ: the Pi sees 5.0 V - ribbon (~0.03 V at 1 A) > 4.63 V throttle. A Schottky here would not do.\nLM74700 inside: needs ~3.9 V to start (runs down to 3.2 V) - fine here on the 5 V side, never on the cell.\nC9/C10/D2 at J1 pins 2/4."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.16 187.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6d59fae7-db5b-5669-9137-4736b07c269f")
	)
	(text "6  RADIO SUPPLY: AP2112K-3.3 (EN = the Pi's 3V3)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "16ecbb2e-8b1b-53f3-a5f0-5d56cb6abaef")
	)
	(text "~0.1 V dropout at 150 mA (600 mA part). EN from 3V3_PI: the radio is off whenever the Pi is off\n(else the SP4 in RX drains ~26 mA from the cell with the box 'off'). The breakout adds 110 uF at the module."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 241.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3f2e3ca9-7ee8-560a-b571-9ec8ed99ebe5")
	)
	(text "7  FUEL GAUGE (Adafruit MAX17048 #5580, I2C 0x36)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.16 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8aff8a40-43f0-572b-9471-5d65b54b2fbc")
	)
	(text "The chip runs from the cell (SJ2 bridged VDD-Bat as shipped); header VIN only feeds its 10 k pull-ups on\nSCL/SDA/INT and the LED (cut SJ1 to save ~0.1 mA): VIN = 3V3_PI. Cell sense through the JP2 Bat/GND\npair (2-pin header, Kelvin track from Q1's source), not a JST-PH lead. QSTART unused (10 k to GND on\nthe module). No level shifting needed at 3.3 V. Software: never set MODE.EnSleep."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.16 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5ebb362d-fdf8-595b-bd36-713070c4740a")
	)
	(text "8  TEST POINTS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 256.54 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "31698bbc-cc73-5683-ab9a-46c59084c16a")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
